Third-party notices
===================

Blitz3D compiler
----------------

Parts of the PolyBasic compiler (src/compiler/lexer.js, src/compiler/parser.js
and src/compiler/semant.js) are derived from the Blitz3D compiler,
(c) Blitz Research Ltd, zlib licence. The code was translated to JavaScript
and changed substantially; the tokenising rules, the statement and expression
parser structure and the typing rules come from it.

The MD2 reader and player (src/engine/model/md2.js) follow Blitz3D's
md2rep.cpp and md2model.cpp, translated to JavaScript; the table of MD2
normals (src/engine/model/md2-normals.js) is copied from its md2norms.cpp
(it is the table of the Quake 2 MD2 format).

